{
  "name": "WhatsApp AI support agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WhatsApp AI support agent\n\n**What it does**\nAnswers customer questions on your WhatsApp Business number using your own FAQ, remembers the last few messages of each chat, and hands the conversation to your team (with a Slack alert) when someone asks for a human.\n\n**You need**\n- A WhatsApp Business Cloud API number in a Meta app\n- OpenAI API key\n- Slack connected to n8n\n\n**Setup**\n1. Connect the WhatsApp Trigger (OAuth credential: Meta app ID and secret) and the WhatsApp send nodes (access token and business account ID).\n2. Replace the FAQ block in **Support agent** with your hours, prices, policies and links. Pick your Slack channel.\n3. Activate the workflow. n8n registers the webhook with Meta for you. Message your number from your own phone to test.\n\nBuilt by AI Strike Force, aistrikeforce.com",
        "height": 740,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "1f75c23b-eb8e-5bd4-8a2c-c4fa415b3e5f",
      "name": "WhatsApp AI support agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\n**Support agent**: paste your FAQ into the system message. Keep it factual; the agent only answers from it.\n**Wants a human?**: the words that trigger a hand-off.\n**Alert the team in Slack**: pick the channel.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "fc436f49-159e-5a02-9988-5a66be6f6b39",
      "name": "Edit me: FAQ and hand-off words",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        -340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "messages"
        ],
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3cefe027-0b99-5dcb-b9c6-0c4776537bec",
      "name": "WhatsApp Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsAppTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "whatsAppTriggerApi": {
          "name": "WhatsApp OAuth account"
        }
      },
      "webhookId": "a56bc68c-ae5e-575c-a585-6c07b9724a4b"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "37e4888c-e3d3-59b6-8590-03cc11e04bb3",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.messages?.[0]?.type }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "rightValue": "text"
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ea050f2c-ac13-57fc-b317-2c36d1ef797b",
      "name": "Only incoming text messages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "656fdd60-4165-586f-9c25-60a8f0c0d8d3",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.messages[0].text.body.toLowerCase() }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              },
              "rightValue": "\\b(human|real person|speak to someone|talk to someone|staff|manager)\\b"
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1f309d9b-8e2c-5001-b254-48a384aece87",
      "name": "Wants a human?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.messages[0].text.body }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are the WhatsApp assistant for Your Business. You are talking to {{ $json.contacts?.[0]?.profile?.name || 'a customer' }}.\n\nRules:\n- Answer only from the FAQ below. If the answer is not there, say you will ask the team and that a person will reply here soon. Never guess prices, dates or policies.\n- Keep replies short: one to three sentences, plain text, no markdown headings.\n- Reply in the customer's language.\n- If they want to talk to a person, tell them to type \"human\".\n\nFAQ:\n- Opening hours: Monday to Friday 9:00 to 18:00, Saturday 10:00 to 14:00.\n- Address: 1 Example Street, Example City.\n- Booking: https://example.com/book\n- Prices: see https://example.com/prices\n- Cancellations: free up to 24 hours before the appointment."
        }
      },
      "id": "d1d7d60a-e915-5181-afc6-507162f19859",
      "name": "Support agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        660,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4.1-mini"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "id": "5e9fedb7-827d-5271-9e3c-52826b4c134f",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        560,
        440
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('WhatsApp Trigger').item.json.messages[0].from }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 10
      },
      "id": "5dd06ed3-2de0-54d9-ad1f-e36e4e8a8e7d",
      "name": "Remember this chat",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        760,
        440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "={{ $('WhatsApp Trigger').item.json.metadata.phone_number_id }}",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ $('WhatsApp Trigger').item.json.messages[0].from }}",
        "textBody": "={{ $json.output }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "a29d236e-a292-521d-8984-46500d2dc965",
      "name": "Send the answer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "whatsAppApi": {
          "name": "WhatsApp account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "text": "=*WhatsApp customer wants a human*\n*From:* {{ $('WhatsApp Trigger').item.json.contacts?.[0]?.profile?.name || 'Unknown' }} (+{{ $('WhatsApp Trigger').item.json.messages[0].from }})\n*Message:* {{ $('WhatsApp Trigger').item.json.messages[0].text.body }}\nReply to them from the inbox your team uses for this WhatsApp number.",
        "otherOptions": {
          "includeLinkToWorkflow": false
        }
      },
      "id": "292a62bf-b260-5102-8dfe-fe87f97e6628",
      "name": "Alert the team in Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "name": "Slack account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "={{ $('WhatsApp Trigger').item.json.metadata.phone_number_id }}",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ $('WhatsApp Trigger').item.json.messages[0].from }}",
        "textBody": "=Thanks, I've passed this to the team. A person will reply here as soon as possible.",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "03ae0866-11f4-57e7-ac84-56cf163a6100",
      "name": "Tell the customer a person will reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
